| M1 gmid_lut | 5·7 | 2(1·1·0) | 0 | 8·211 → 1·20 | 7 → 1 | 5 → 1 |
| M2 topology_authoring | 15·10 | 7(4·2·1) | 1(future) | 17·418 → 7·224 | 72 → 60 | 8 → 4 |
